  "bodyHtml": "\n\n\t\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2023-09-12T16:19:08-04:00\" title=\"Tuesday, September 12, 2023, 4:19 pm\">September 12, 2023</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-content\">\n\t\t\t<p>Members Carroll &amp; Peter Sivco are currently showing their art at the Cape Cod Cooperative Bank in East Harwich through September.  Their expressive paintings are viewable during regular banking hours. The couple also organizes the monthly solo shows allowing members to showcase their work.  For more information contact Carroll at csivco@comcast.net.</p>\n<p><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6652\" src=\"/media/archive/6f2c8194584e2705b442f85b6116e791b04ff51517a1b56c609d50414d42a8aa.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"257\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<footer class=\"entry-footer\">\n\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-terms category\">Posted in <a href=\"/archive/source-e23b79be08a822c7b682/\" rel=\"tag\">WHAT'S NEW</a></span>\t\t\t\t\t</footer>\n\n\t\n",
